# F-23B license map

The combined F-23B community software distribution is licensed under the
GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version
(`GPL-3.0-or-later`). The complete GPLv3 text is in `COPYING`.

Project-original source files that carry `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` retain
their MIT grant. The complete MIT text is in `LICENSES/MIT.txt`. When those
files are conveyed as part of a combined work containing GPL-covered F-22A
derived code, the combined work is conveyed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Files with another explicit SPDX identifier or provenance record remain under
their stated terms. Models, textures, audio, documentation, missions, and
other non-code content are not relicensed by this file. See
`LICENSE-ASSETS.md` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` before redistribution.

No Eagle Dynamics or DCS proprietary code, binary, or asset is licensed or
redistributed by this project.
